WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:02.360
You and I will go to the north

00:02.440 --> 00:03.200
With a unit

00:03.320 --> 00:04.480
Act flexibly

00:04.560 --> 00:05.240
Let's go

00:05.320 --> 00:06.400
I accept the order

00:06.920 --> 00:08.420
Forces divided, neither gate could be held. Shi Lang launched elite troops against the West Gate, breaching the city in a single assault.

00:08.500 --> 00:20.500
Even with the volunteer army joining, you could barely muster five thousand men. You committed everyone you could mobilize to the defense of the North City.

